{"id":"Cb3d0f8d55fbc98df7b52","zh":"傅里叶变换","en":"Fourier Transform","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"将信号表示为频率分量并实现时域与频域转换的变换。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"用于分析时间信号或空间采样序列的频率组成，为相干分析提供频域基础，并作为小波和相关分析的参照。还用于联系自相关函数与谱分布，解释Wigner–Ville分布与功率谱密度的关系。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"Cb3d0f8d55fbc98df7b52","zh":"傅里叶变换","en":"Fourier Transform","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H36f469489caf70225b82","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2017）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Db3aee7da55105451f92d","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"傅里叶变换"},{"id":"D6a6ce969968e536ed619","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"Fourier Transform"}],"sources":{"P110":{"id":"P110","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2017","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2017.04.002","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2017）","overview_slug":"2017-time-frequency-energy-joint-analysis-method-for-railway-track-irregularity"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S49d9594fb3ba529f5369","source_id":"P110","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"由于传统傅里叶变换FT(Fourier Transform) 在整体上将信号分解为不同的频率分量,缺乏局域信息,并且轨道不平顺时程序列往往包含多于一种基本成分,应该将轨道不平顺考虑为以空间里程、幅值和波长为变量的三维函数。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S3f29cd67d0709bcfae44","source_id":"P110","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"对式(1)进行傅里叶变换,得到WVD的一般表达形式 WVDs(t,ω)=∫ +∞ -∞rs(t, τ)e -iτωdτ (2) 式中: τ为两时间点的间隔。","citations":[{"source_id":"P110","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P110","title":"铁路轨道不平顺的时-频能量联合分析方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2017","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2017.04.002","journa